      "description": "Edge router for the machine room. It routes between the server VLAN and\nthe outside world, and reaches the core switch over a routed (untagged)\ncopper link in the same rack — the one run in this inventory that does not\ncross a patch panel.\n",
      "labels": {
        "env": "prod",
        "role": "edge",
        "site": "hq"
